# munsters_pro 1.28 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-07 by a build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 14 of its 27 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end, bonus_start, bonus_end.
# Shots no press made: Lower p/f left orbit opto, Lower p/f machine target, Lower p/f right ramp, Shot 0x10, Shot 0x1000, Shot 0x1000000, Shot 0x2, Shot 0x20, Shot 0x200, Shot 0x200000, Shot 0x2000000, Shot 0x4000000, Shot 0x80000.

